# Agent Commons

Follow shared agent defaults:

- Prefer simple, direct fixes over broad abstractions.
- Use existing project conventions before adding new patterns.
- Verify non-trivial changes before calling work done.
- Keep replies concise, concrete, and grounded in observed facts.
- For test update/run/fix loops, delegate to a Composer 2.5 subagent and have it
  cross-check relevant repo agent rules while tests run.
- For git/Graphite work, delegate to a git/shell subagent using GPT-5.5 high
  when available; ask before substituting if that exact model is unavailable.
